:: MP Extra Deep Foghorn 6 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "sea">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>><<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
<<if Weather.precipitation is "rain">>雨雾扑打着海蚀暗穴最深处的断崖石台，<<else>>落潮后的海蚀暗穴最深处露出断崖石台，<</if>>双轮潮汐钟后方的岩壁暗槽里横放着一具密封海图铜筒，旁边垂着一条连接防波闸门的青铜滑车链。<<if ($mpQuestShipwreck or 0) gte 3 or ($mpQuestCliffLighthouse or 0) gte 2>>你结合沉船暗仓与雾角灯塔的海图坐标，顺利对上了铜筒外圈的经纬刻度。<</if>>
<<if $mpClues["clue_deep5_foghorn"]>><span class="teal">凭着先前点亮鲸油信标灯时映出的石壁折光，你一眼认出了海图铜筒的防水卡槽。</span><</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[退回海蚀回音廊 (0:03)|MP Region Foghorn Echo]]>><<pass 3>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<if $daily.mpDeep6_foghorn is 1>>
断崖石台上的密封海图铜筒今日已查验妥当，防波闸门稳固如初。
<<else>>
<div id="act-mp-extra-deep-foghorn-6">
<<investigateicon>><<link "旋开铜筒封盖查海图 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#act-mp-extra-deep-foghorn-6">>
<<if (($science or 0) + ($mpClues['clue_deep5_foghorn'] ? 60 : 0)) gte 260 or ($history or 0) gte 250>>
	<<set $daily.mpDeep6_foghorn to 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("deep_foghorn_6_rew")>><<money 460>>铜筒内壁除了古航道图，还裹着一袋旧港领航公会留下的压舱银币。<<else>>羊皮海图保存得干爽平整，暗礁水道标示得一清二楚。<</if>><span class="green">你从海蚀暗穴深处起出了领航公会的古海图。</span><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[收妥银币返回回音廊 (0:04)|MP Region Foghorn Echo]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	铜筒封盖凝着一层滑腻海盐，拧动时震麻了虎口。<span class="red">你甩了甩手腕退后半步。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[擦净封盖海盐再旋 (0:04)|MP Extra Deep Foghorn 6]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[先退回引航石台 (0:03)|MP Region Foghorn Echo]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "拉动青铜滑车降下防波闸 (0:08)">><<pass 8>><<replace "#act-mp-extra-deep-foghorn-6">>
<<if (($physique or 10000) + ($mpClues['clue_deep5_foghorn'] ? 600 : 0)) gte 11600 or ($skulduggery or 0) gte 260>>
	<<set $daily.mpDeep6_foghorn to 1>>mpAntiquesUnappraised<<science 2>><<gscience>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("deep_foghorn_6_rew_alt")>><<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>>防波闸门稳稳落槽，链轮暗格里弹出一枚刻着海事暗记的青铜分度仪，你将其收入怀中留待鉴藏。<<else>>青铜滑车链顺滑咬合，暗穴外的浪涌顿时平息下来。<</if>><span class="green">你借滑车链稳住了整座暗穴的潮汐水位。</span><<tiredness -2>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[沿栈桥返回雾角灯塔 (0:04)|MP Region Foghorn Island]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	滑车链环沾满湿海藻，拉拽时手心打滑。<span class="red">你抓紧干爽链节稳住身形。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[裹上粗麻布重新拉链 (0:04)|MP Extra Deep Foghorn 6]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[暂回雾角栈桥 (0:03)|MP Region Foghorn Pier]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>
<</if>>

:: MP Extra Deep Clockwork 6 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "underground">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>><<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
<<if Time.dayState is "night">>子夜的机括城密库最底层共鸣腔内，<<else>>恒温静谧的机括城密库最底层共鸣腔内，<</if>>星历差分筒下方连通着一具巨型黄铜报时音鼓，旁边搁着一排带编号的钨钢调音销与一把校频扳手。<<if ($mpQuestClocktower or 0) gte 2 or ($mpQuestElkWorkshop or 0) gte 2>>你对照钟塔主轴与工坊图纸的齿数，一眼认出了音鼓上的十二宫校准孔。<</if>>
<<if $mpClues["clue_deep5_clockwork"]>><span class="teal">借着方才挂好补偿铅锤稳住的发条张力，中央报时音鼓的止逆销已自行松开。</span><</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[退回档案馆密库 (0:03)|MP Region Clockwork Vault]]>><<pass 3>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<if $daily.mpDeep6_clockwork is 1>>
底层共鸣腔的黄铜报时音鼓今日已校频完毕，低鸣声平稳深沉。
<<else>>
<div id="act-mp-extra-deep-clockwork-6">
<<investigateicon>><<link "用校频扳手拨正音鼓 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#act-mp-extra-deep-clockwork-6">>
<<if (($science or 0) + ($mpClues['clue_deep5_clockwork'] ? 60 : 0)) gte 260 or ($maths or 0) gte 260>>
	<<set $daily.mpDeep6_clockwork to 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("deep_clockwork_6_rew")>><<money 460>>音鼓归位瞬间，底座托盘滑出一匣早年总钟表匠留存的铸币局银币。<<else>>黄铜音鼓的共鸣声浑厚悠长，与整座地下城的脉搏完美同步。<</if>><span class="green">你校准了机括城最底层的中央报时音鼓。</span><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[收妥银币返回密库 (0:04)|MP Region Clockwork Vault]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	音鼓边缘的定位簧反弹有力，震得扳手偏了半格。<span class="red">你活动手腕重新卡准槽位。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[锁紧扳手卡口再拨 (0:04)|MP Extra Deep Clockwork 6]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[先退回密库外间 (0:03)|MP Region Clockwork Vault]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "按齿序插入钨钢调音销 (0:08)">><<pass 8>><<replace "#act-mp-extra-deep-clockwork-6">>
<<if (($skulduggery or 0) + ($mpClues['clue_deep5_clockwork'] ? 60 : 0)) gte 260 or ($history or 0) gte 250>>
	<<set $daily.mpDeep6_clockwork to 1>>mpAntiquesUnappraised<<skulduggery 2>><<gskulduggery>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("deep_clockwork_6_rew_alt")>><<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>>十二枚调音销严丝合缝，音鼓内芯弹出一枚失传已久的蓝钢擒纵古件，你将其妥善收进绒布袋。<<else>>调音销依次敲击出清越的八度音阶，回荡在深层廊道间。<</if>><span class="green">你凭精密齿序复原了古音鼓的报时曲谱。</span><<tiredness -2>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[沿主轴梯返回机括城 (0:04)|MP Region Clockwork Undercity]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	第三枚调音销沾了机油，插落时滑出了孔位。<span class="red">你用棉布擦净销杆油渍。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[擦干调音销重新插入 (0:04)|MP Extra Deep Clockwork 6]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[暂回停摆天文台 (0:03)|MP Region Clockwork Astro]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>
<</if>>

:: MP Extra Deep Abbey 6 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "temple">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>><<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
<<if Weather.precipitation is "rain">>地面雨声透过沉没修道院地底石室的通风井传来，<<else>>烛光幽微的沉没修道院地下圣礼密室内，<</if>>祭台后方露出一扇雕着双鸽衔橄榄枝的青石暗门，门侧石龛里放着一只白银香炉与一卷羊皮圣咏谱。<<if ($mpQuestCatacomb or 0) gte 3 or ($mpQuestMoonAltar or 0) gte 2>>你认出双鸽浮雕下方的古拉丁祝词与神殿地宫碑文同源，摸准了按压顺序。<</if>>
<<if $mpClues["clue_deep5_abbey"]>><span class="teal">借着方才挑亮的石脂长明灯光，祭台后方石壁上的双鸽浮雕暗缝清晰可见。</span><</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[退回灰烬藏经阁 (0:03)|MP Region Abbey Scriptorium]]>><<pass 3>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<if $daily.mpDeep6_abbey is 1>>
地下圣礼密室的双鸽青石门今日已开启查验，白银香炉余香袅袅。
<<else>>
<div id="act-mp-extra-deep-abbey-6">
<<investigateicon>><<link "按祝词次序推双鸽浮雕 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#act-mp-extra-deep-abbey-6">>
<<if (($history or 0) + ($mpClues['clue_deep5_abbey'] ? 60 : 0)) gte 260 or ($willpower or 0) gte 440>>
	<<set $daily.mpDeep6_abbey to 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("deep_abbey_6_rew")>><<money 460>>青石暗门缓缓滑开，石匣里整整齐齐码放着早年修道院封存的避难募捐银币。<<else>>青石暗门平稳开启，密室内的古石雕保存得完好如初。<</if>><span class="green">你开启了沉没修道院最深处的圣礼密室。</span><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[收好银币返回藏经阁 (0:04)|MP Region Abbey Scriptorium]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	青石浮雕边缘凝着冷露，推按时指尖滑了半寸。<span class="red">你搓热手掌定下心神。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[按准浮雕羽翼再推 (0:04)|MP Extra Deep Abbey 6]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[先退回藏经阁外廊 (0:03)|MP Region Abbey Scriptorium]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "展平羊皮圣咏谱核对暗记 (0:08)">><<pass 8>><<replace "#act-mp-extra-deep-abbey-6">>
<<if (($english or 0) + ($mpClues['clue_deep5_abbey'] ? 60 : 0)) gte 260 or ($tending or 0) gte 250>>
	<<set $daily.mpDeep6_abbey to 1>>mpAntiquesUnappraised<<history 2>><<ghistory>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("deep_abbey_6_rew_alt")>><<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>>圣咏谱夹层里滑出一枚镌刻着古修会徽记的纯银圣章，你将这件珍贵旧物妥善收好。<<else>>羊皮圣咏谱上的泥金字母在灯下熠熠生辉，令人心境澄明。<</if>><span class="green">你从圣咏谱中参透了修道院失传的秘史。</span><<tiredness -2>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[沿石阶返回沉没修道院 (0:04)|MP Region Sunken Abbey]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	羊皮纸卷边角脆硬，展平时险些折损页脚。<span class="red">你忙放轻呼吸托住纸卷。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[借香炉微温润纸再展 (0:04)|MP Extra Deep Abbey 6]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[暂回静默石阶 (0:03)|MP Region Abbey Steps]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>
<</if>>

:: MP Extra Deep Glasshouse 6 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "avery_mansion">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>><<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
<<if Time.dayState is "night">>夜深人静的秘密温室地下母株保育室里，<<else>>暖雾萦绕的秘密温室地下母株保育室里，<</if>>整面玻璃墙后护着一株百年银脉母兰，恒温柜旁设着一排黄铜滴滤阀与一只紫檀标本匣。<<if ($mpQuestGreenhouse or 0) gte 3 or ($mpQuestGardenWell or 0) gte 2>>你结合公园旧温室与古井水脉的培育记录，算准了母株营养液的滴速。<</if>>
<<if $mpClues["clue_deep5_glasshouse"]>><span class="teal">凭着方才提取的冷兰秘露样本，你一眼认出了水晶恒温柜顶部的导入阀门。</span><</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[退回夜光标本廊 (0:03)|MP Region Glasshouse Specimen]]>><<pass 3>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<if $daily.mpDeep6_glasshouse is 1>>
地下保育室的百年银脉母兰今日已照料妥当，花瓣泛着莹润光泽。
<<else>>
<div id="act-mp-extra-deep-glasshouse-6">
<<investigateicon>><<link "调节滴滤阀滋养母株 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#act-mp-extra-deep-glasshouse-6">>
<<if (($tending or 0) + ($mpClues['clue_deep5_glasshouse'] ? 60 : 0)) gte 260 or ($science or 0) gte 260>>
	<<set $daily.mpDeep6_glasshouse to 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("deep_glasshouse_6_rew")>><<money 460>>母株叶片舒展，恒温柜底座弹出园艺总监预留的一袋珍稀育种奖金。<<else>>营养液滴速均匀，银脉母兰散发出的幽香令你神清气爽。<</if>><span class="green">你精心调理好了秘密温室最珍贵的银脉母兰。</span><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[收妥奖金返回标本廊 (0:04)|MP Region Glasshouse Specimen]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	滴滤阀旋钮凝着水珠，拧动时流速快了半拍。<span class="red">你赶紧回旋半圈稳住液面。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[擦干铜阀旋钮重调 (0:04)|MP Extra Deep Glasshouse 6]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[先退回标本廊外侧 (0:03)|MP Region Glasshouse Specimen]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "开启紫檀匣采集凝露花蕊 (0:08)">><<pass 8>><<replace "#act-mp-extra-deep-glasshouse-6">>
<<if (($skulduggery or 0) + ($mpClues['clue_deep5_glasshouse'] ? 60 : 0)) gte 260 or ($housekeeping or 0) gte 250>>
	<<set $daily.mpDeep6_glasshouse to 1>>mpHerbsCollected<<tending 2>><<gtending>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("deep_glasshouse_6_rew_alt")>><<set $mpHerbsCollected to ($mpHerbsCollected or 0) + 1>>你将自然脱落的银脉凝露花蕊收入紫檀小瓶贴身存好，留作日后调香与炼制的上等草药。<<else>>紫檀匣内的干燥花瓣依然保持着初绽时的色泽与芬芳。<</if>><span class="green">你采下了可遇不可求的银脉母兰凝露花蕊。</span><<tiredness -2>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[沿花径返回秘密温室 (0:04)|MP Region Glasshouse Manor]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	紫檀匣搭扣颇紧，挑动时震落了叶片上的一滴露珠。<span class="red">你屏息凝神稳住指尖。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[用竹镊轻挑搭扣再开 (0:04)|MP Extra Deep Glasshouse 6]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[暂回雾化兰花厅 (0:03)|MP Region Glasshouse Orchid]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>
<</if>>

:: MP Extra Deep Blackiron 6 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "docks">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>><<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
<<if Weather.precipitation is "rain">>雨雾顺着黑铁货运站地底转车台的通风井飘入，<<else>>煤烟味未散的黑铁货运站地底转车台旁，<</if>>生铁转盘中央立着一座双柄联锁闸箱，旁边铁架上挂着一盏防爆信号灯与一盒铅封钳。<<if ($mpQuestSmuggler or 0) gte 3 or ($mpQuestFoundry or 0) gte 2>>你对照港区走私暗道与铸铁厂的铁轨制式，看清了转车台锁销的卡位。<</if>>
<<if $mpClues["clue_deep5_blackiron"]>><span class="teal">凭着方才发报机回执确认的空车轨位，你径直找到了地底转车台的主控闸箱。</span><</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[退回地下走私月台 (0:03)|MP Region Blackiron Platform]]>><<pass 3>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<if $daily.mpDeep6_blackiron is 1>>
地底转车台的联锁闸箱今日已锁定妥当，备用轨道畅通无阻。
<<else>>
<div id="act-mp-extra-deep-blackiron-6">
<<investigateicon>><<link "扳动联锁闸箱对齐暗轨 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#act-mp-extra-deep-blackiron-6">>
<<if (($physique or 10000) + ($mpClues['clue_deep5_blackiron'] ? 600 : 0)) gte 11600 or ($science or 0) gte 250>>
	<<set $daily.mpDeep6_blackiron to 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("deep_blackiron_6_rew")>><<money 460>>生铁转盘轰然合轨，闸箱底部弹出一袋铁路联运商预留的调度津贴。<<else>>转车台导轨严丝合缝，防爆信号灯亮起清澈的绿光。<</if>><span class="green">你打通了黑铁货运站地底转车台的隐秘轨线。</span><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[收妥津贴返回走私月台 (0:04)|MP Region Blackiron Platform]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	联锁闸杆沉重冰凉，拉到半途时被卡簧顶了回来。<span class="red">你踩稳铁踏板缓了口气。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[踩下解卡踏板重扳闸杆 (0:04)|MP Extra Deep Blackiron 6]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[先退回走私月台边 (0:03)|MP Region Blackiron Platform]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "用铅封钳拓下专线通行章 (0:08)">><<pass 8>><<replace "#act-mp-extra-deep-blackiron-6">>
<<if (($skulduggery or 0) + ($mpClues['clue_deep5_blackiron'] ? 60 : 0)) gte 260 or ($english or 0) gte 250>>
	<<set $daily.mpDeep6_blackiron to 1>>mpAntiquesUnappraised<<skulduggery 2>><<gskulduggery>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("deep_blackiron_6_rew_alt")>><<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>>你用铅封钳压出一枚带总站暗记的黄铜母模，又取走匣内的古旧站务铜牌留作凭据。<<else>>铅封钳齿口清晰锐利，压出的通行印记分毫不差。<</if>><span class="green">你掌握了夜间货运专线的最高通行铅封。</span><<tiredness -2>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[顺岔道返回黑铁货站 (0:04)|MP Region Blackiron Yard]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	铅封锡片偏厚，夹压时钳柄滑了一下。<span class="red">你换过一枚软铅片重新对位。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[对准母模凹槽重压铅封 (0:04)|MP Extra Deep Blackiron 6]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[暂回蒸汽机车侧线 (0:03)|MP Region Blackiron Siding]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>
<</if>>

:: MP Extra Deep Druid 6 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "forest">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>><<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
<<if Time.dayState is "night">>月光穿透深林古石环最深处的千年橡树冠，<<else>>晨露清冽的深林古石环最深处千年橡树下，<</if>>古树根系怀抱的树心石龛半掩着，龛前青石板上摆着一只盛满琥珀松香的石钵与一束白槲寄生。<<if ($mpQuestManorRuins or 0) gte 2 or ($mpQuestMoonAltar or 0) gte 2>>你对照古庄园遗迹与月神祭坛的符文，认出了石龛表面的四季轮转刻痕。<</if>>
<<if $mpClues["clue_deep5_druid"]>><span class="teal">借着方才清露润泽古根后泛起的白藓银辉，你顺利找出了树心石龛的活栓。</span><</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[退回古根地穴 (0:03)|MP Region Druid Rootcave]]>><<pass 3>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<if $daily.mpDeep6_druid is 1>>
千年橡树下的树心石龛今日已合拢封妥，松香气息清幽绵长。
<<else>>
<div id="act-mp-extra-deep-druid-6">
<<investigateicon>><<link "按四季刻痕旋开树心石龛 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#act-mp-extra-deep-druid-6">>
<<if (($history or 0) + ($mpClues['clue_deep5_druid'] ? 60 : 0)) gte 260 or ($tending or 0) gte 260>>
	<<set $daily.mpDeep6_druid to 1>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("deep_druid_6_rew")>><<money 460>>石龛悄然洞开，里面放着一只盛满古代守林人供奉银币的鹿皮袋。<<else>>树心石龛内干燥温润，古木清香令人心旷神怡。<</if>><span class="green">你开启了深林古石环千年橡树下的树心石龛。</span><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[收妥银币返回古根地穴 (0:04)|MP Region Druid Rootcave]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	石龛外圈覆着湿滑青苔，旋动时指腹打滑。<span class="red">你拿干树叶拭净手指苔痕。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[擦净石龛青苔重旋 (0:04)|MP Extra Deep Druid 6]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[先退回古根地穴口 (0:03)|MP Region Druid Rootcave]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "将白槲寄生浸入松香石钵 (0:08)">><<pass 8>><<replace "#act-mp-extra-deep-druid-6">>
<<if (($willpower or 0) + ($mpClues['clue_deep5_druid'] ? 60 : 0)) gte 440 or ($science or 0) gte 250>>
	<<set $daily.mpDeep6_druid to 1>>mpHerbsCollected<<tending 2>><<gtending>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("deep_druid_6_rew_alt")>><<set $mpHerbsCollected to ($mpHerbsCollected or 0) + 1>>松香凝结在白槲寄生枝头化作晶莹香丸，你将这味罕见的安神灵药收入药囊贴身保存。<<else>>松香与槲寄生的清气交融，林间飞鸟纷纷落在枝头轻鸣。<</if>><span class="green">你制成了古石环秘传的松香槲寄生药丸。</span><<tiredness -2>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[沿林径返回深林古石环 (0:04)|MP Region Druid Circle]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	琥珀松香尚未完全温化，枝叶沾取时略显粘滞。<span class="red">你双手拢住石钵借体温暖化松香。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[温化松香后重新浸润 (0:04)|MP Extra Deep Druid 6]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[暂回月泉祭坛 (0:03)|MP Region Druid Moonwell]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>
<</if>>

:: MP Quest Velvet Mirage 10 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "brothel">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>><<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
<<if Time.dayState is "night">>子夜的天鹅绒暗层最核心螺钿主账室内，<<else>>烛光幽邃的天鹅绒暗层最核心螺钿主账室内，<</if>>紫檀圆桌上摆着一只双层转轮印鉴匣与一盏孔雀石香炉，匣旁压着一份未盖章的暗港通行契书。<<if ($mpQuestVelvetMirage or 0) gte 8>>你对照前九次查清的沙龙底账与贵宾代号，一眼认出了螺钿密门后的主账室布局。<</if>>
<<if $mpClues["clue_velvet_mirage_9"]>><span class="teal">凭着方才在双盘天平上校准过的狐面银章配重，暗廊尽头那扇镶螺钿密门的机括已然解锁。</span><</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[退回私人拍卖暗厅 (0:03)|MP Region Velvet Auction]]>><<pass 3>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<if $daily.mpVelvetMirage10 is 1>>
螺钿主账室的双层转轮印鉴匣今日已核验妥当，孔雀石香炉青烟袅袅。
<<else>>
<div id="act-mp-quest-velvet-mirage-10">
<<investigateicon>><<link "旋开双层印鉴匣取分红 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#act-mp-quest-velvet-mirage-10">>
<<if (($skulduggery or 0) + ($mpClues['clue_velvet_mirage_9'] ? 60 : 0)) gte 260 or ($seductionskill or 0) gte 260>>
