	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("velvet_mirage_10_rew")>><<money 480>>印鉴匣底屉滑开，你将里面封存的沙龙终极压轴红利金票收入囊中。<<else>>双层印鉴匣内衬整洁，所有贵宾往来账目皆已在你掌握之中。<</if>><span class="green">你彻底揭开了天鹅绒暗层主账室的全部秘密。</span><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[收妥金票返回拍卖暗厅 (0:04)|MP Region Velvet Auction]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	印鉴匣内圈的弹簧锁卡得颇紧，旋动时偏了半格。<span class="red">你放轻呼吸重新听准簧片声。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[对准内圈刻度重旋印鉴匣 (0:04)|MP Quest Velvet Mirage 10]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[先退回拍卖暗厅外廊 (0:03)|MP Region Velvet Auction]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "在通行契书盖下暗港母印 (0:08)">><<pass 8>><<replace "#act-mp-quest-velvet-mirage-10">>
<<if (($english or 0) + ($mpClues['clue_velvet_mirage_9'] ? 60 : 0)) gte 260 or ($danceskill or 0) gte 250>>
	<<set $daily.mpVelvetMirage10 to 1>><<set $mpQuestVelvetMirage to Math.max(($mpQuestVelvetMirage or 0), 10)>>mpAntiquesUnappraised<<seductionskill 2>><<gseduction>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("velvet_mirage_10_rew_alt")>><<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>>朱红火漆印记清晰落定，你收起盖妥母印的通行契书与副印铜章，自此在暗层来去自如。<<else>>母印纹路端正威严，孔雀石香炉的暖香萦绕在指尖。<</if>><span class="green">你取得了天鹅绒暗层最高等级的通行契印。</span><<tiredness -2>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[经私密旋梯回天鹅绒暗层 (0:04)|MP Region Velvet Mirage]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	火漆融化得略慢，盖印时边缘还不够饱满。<span class="red">你把火漆勺凑近烛火再温片刻。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[待火漆匀润后重新盖印 (0:04)|MP Quest Velvet Mirage 10]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[暂回观海露台 (0:03)|MP Region Velvet Terrace]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>
<</if>>

:: MP Quest Observatory Wing 10 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "school">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>>
<<set $daily to ($daily or {})>><<set $mpClues to ($mpClues or {})>>
<<if Time.dayState is "night">>群星璀璨的旧天文翼楼最高观星台中央，<<else>>晴光通透的旧天文翼楼最高观星台中央，<</if>>赤道仪主镜筒下方设着一座黄铜子午环与一只紫晶棱镜匣，旁边摊着历任首席观测员的签名金册。<<if ($mpQuestObservatoryWing or 0) gte 8>>你融会贯通了前九次记录的黄道赤纬数据，将整座翼楼的星钟差值算至分毫。<</if>>
<<if $mpClues["clue_obs_wing_9"]>><span class="teal">借着方才从铜版星表拓下的隐藏星位，你一眼找准了穹顶主折光镜底座的校准螺杆。</span><</if>>
