<<getouticon>><<link [[退回折光穹顶室 (0:03)|MP Region Observatory Dome]]>><<pass 3>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
<br>
<<if $daily.mpObsWing10 is 1>>
最高观星台的黄铜子午环今日已校准完毕，紫晶棱镜折射出澄澈光芒。
<<else>>
<div id="act-mp-quest-observatory-wing-10">
<<investigateicon>><<link "旋动黄铜子午环锁定本初线 (0:07)">><<pass 7>><<replace "#act-mp-quest-observatory-wing-10">>
<<if (($science or 0) + ($mpClues['clue_obs_wing_9'] ? 60 : 0)) gte 260 or ($maths or 0) gte 260>>
	<<set $daily.mpObsWing10 to 1>><<set $mpQuestObservatoryWing to Math.max(($mpQuestObservatoryWing or 0), 10)>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("obs_wing_10_rew")>><<money 480>>子午环归位锁死，基座暗格弹出一封学会封存的终身观测荣誉奖金。<<else>>黄铜子午环与天顶星位严丝合缝，主镜视场清澈无比。<</if>><span class="green">你完成了旧天文翼楼百年星钟的最终校准。</span><<stress -3>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<walkicon>><<link [[收妥奖金返回穹顶室 (0:04)|MP Region Observatory Dome]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	子午环微调丝杆略紧，旋动时差了半格角秒。<span class="red">你凝视游标尺重新对准零位。</span><<pain 1>><<stress 3>><<gpain>><<gstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[看准游标尺重旋子午环 (0:04)|MP Quest Observatory Wing 10]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[先退回穹顶室下层 (0:03)|MP Region Observatory Dome]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
<br>
<<link "嵌合紫晶棱镜并在金册留名 (0:08)">><<pass 8>><<replace "#act-mp-quest-observatory-wing-10">>
<<if (($history or 0) + ($mpClues['clue_obs_wing_9'] ? 60 : 0)) gte 260 or ($english or 0) gte 260>>
	<<set $daily.mpObsWing10 to 1>><<set $mpQuestObservatoryWing to Math.max(($mpQuestObservatoryWing or 0), 10)>>mpAntiquesUnappraised<<science 2>><<gscience>>
	<<if window.dolmp && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward && window.dolmp.claimUniqueReward("obs_wing_10_rew_alt")>><<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>>星光经紫晶棱镜凝于金册页首，你签下名字并收起匣内附赠的古董分光镜留作纪念。<<else>>金册上的签名在星辉下熠熠生辉，整座天文翼楼仿佛为你静默致意。<</if>><span class="green">你在旧天文翼楼首席观测金册上留下了自己的名字。</span><<tiredness -2>><<stress -2>><<ltiredness>><<lstress>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[沿旋转梯返回天文翼楼 (0:04)|MP Region Observatory Wing]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
<<else>>
	紫晶棱镜底座的卡簧略滑，嵌入时角度偏了一线。<span class="red">你用鹿皮布托稳棱镜两侧。</span><<stress 3>><<tiredness 1>><<gstress>><<gtiredness>>
	<br><br>
	<<link [[托稳紫晶棱镜重新嵌合 (0:04)|MP Quest Observatory Wing 10]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>
	<br>
	<<link [[暂回星图档案室 (0:03)|MP Region Observatory Star]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
<</if>>
<</replace>><</link>>
</div>
<</if>>
